[00:10.42]From house to house, from door to door,
[00:15.54]Jehovah’s word we spread.
[00:20.62]From town to town, from farm to farm,
[00:27.18]Jehovah’s sheep are fed.
[00:30.98]The good news that God’s Kingdom rules,
[00:36.10]As Jesus Christ foretold,
[00:41.14]Is now declared throughout the earth
[00:46.28]By Christians young and old.
[00:52.55]From house to house, from door to door,
[01:01.54]Salvation we proclaim.
[01:06.84]It comes to those who make the choice
[01:12.00]To call upon God’s name.
[01:17.12]But how can they respect the name
[01:22.12]Of One they do not know?
[01:27.42]To ev’ry home and ev’ry door,
[01:32.46]The sacred name must go.
[01:45.48]So let us go from door to door
[01:50.32]To spread the Kingdom news.
[01:55.66]And whether it’s embraced or not,
[02:00.78]We’ll let the people choose.
[02:06.06]At least we’ll name Jehovah’s name,
[02:11.16]His glorious truth declare.
[02:16.28]And as we go from door to door,
[02:43.48]We’ll find his sheep are there.
